OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start for most, turning
OL,6,Fwetter and windier from the southwest
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. This rain heavy
OL,8,Ffor a time, before clearing off to the
OL,9,Feast by the evening. Feeling rather
OL,10,Fchilly under that cloud and rain.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry to start this
OL,13,Fevening, with the odd spot of rain.
OL,14,FBefore heavy rain moves into the early
OL,15,Fhours of Thursday, though winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
