OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThe odd spot of rain around
OL,6,Fto start on Thursday before sunny
OL,7,Fspells develop through the day.
OL,8,FFeeling pleasant with light winds,
OL,9,Fbefore Storm Austen arrives through
OL,10,Fthe evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHeavy
OL,13,Frain on Friday with strong winds,
OL,14,Ffuelled by Storm Austen. Turning drier
OL,15,Finto Saturday, with sunny spells
OL,16,Fbefore turning very wet and windy
OL,17,Flater. Drier but breezy on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
